1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:02,950
The United States narrowly
averted catastrophe today

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:06,300
as a three-pronged
terrorist assault was foiled.

3
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:12,170
Authorities were able to derail attempts
to detonate atomic devices in Nashville,

4
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,120
Los Angeles, and Manhattan.

5
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:17,230
The identities of the terrorists
are still unknown

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:21,370
as no group has stepped forward
to claim responsibility for the acts.

7
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:26,970
FBI spokesman Herbert Mangels said today,
"Several devices, which we believe

8
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:31,240
to be nuclear in nature, were recovered
before they could be detonated.

9
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:34,290
We are investigating
how they were brought into the country

10
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:36,510
and are following every angle."

11
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:40,710
The president praised the preparedness
and swiftness of action of the FBI

12
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:44,990
and local authorities, noting
that they had saved not only his life,

13
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:47,680
but the lives of millions of Americans.
